# Canonical author identities, so one person is counted once — in `git shortlog`,
# `git log --use-mailmap`, and the About ▸ Contributions page (which is built from
# `git shortlog`). Left of each line is the name/email to show; the trailing
# <email> (and optional name) is the commit identity it replaces. This changes
# nothing in history, only how identities are displayed.

